issue.body:
Having on mixin.less

``` less
.mixin-test() {
  .test {
    color: red;
    &:first-child {
      color: blue;
    }
  }
}
```

And main.less

``` less
@import (reference) "mixin.less";

.mixin-test();
```

It Outputs:

``` css
.test {
  color: red;
}
```

but if I remove the (reference) it prints

``` css
.test {
  color: red;
}
.test:first-child {
  color: blue;
}
```

lessc 1.7.0 (LESS Compiler) [JavaScript]

Not sure if it's related to: https://github.com/less/less.js/issues/1851

